# Warbriar Blessing's ruling, the same trigger: "If this Aura leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield triggered
# ability resolves, the creature it last enchanted before it left will be the one to fight" (CR 608.2h). With the trigger on the
# stack, Bot2's Haywire Mite exiles Meltstrider's Resolve ("exile target noncreature artifact or noncreature enchantment"), so
# Edge Rover is a 2/2 again, and it still fights Bot2's Curious Farm Animals: the Farm Animals die and the Rover keeps 1 damage.
# Bot2 gains 2 from the Mite and 3 from the Farm Animals.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Edge Rover
Forest
Meltstrider's Resolve
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Curious Farm Animals
Haywire Mite
Plains x15

